# Line endings and encoding guard.
#
# This repository intentionally keeps its historical mix of CRLF and LF.
# We disable git's automatic text conversion so it never re-normalizes or
# re-encodes files, which would otherwise create huge spurious diffs
# (the same class of churn as the one-time UTF-8 normalization commit).
#
# Source files must be saved as UTF-8 (with BOM). See .editorconfig for the
# per-extension `charset = utf-8-bom` rules that enforce this in editors.
* -text

# Binary assets: never diff or normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.cur  binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.lib  binary
*.pdb  binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.gz   binary
*.pdf  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.avi  binary
